# Swift style

- Prefer `@Observable` classes over `ObservableObject` / `@Published`.
- No force unwraps (`!`) outside tests. Use `guard let`, `if let`, or `??`.
- Keep view models thin: filtering and persistence live in `ProviderStore`, not in views.
- Match existing naming: `displayName`, `systemImage`, `isInNetwork(for:)`.
- Do not add third-party SPM packages without an explicit ask.
